      "writtenOn": "2023-01-26T23:36:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I know this change doesn\u0027t do anything to `ap_power_force_shutdown`, but is there a plan for making that handle threading safely? It currently forces power signals to G3 without the state machine\u0027s cooperation (assuming the state machine will follow along and remain in sync) but I think we need to ensure that transition occurs within state machine context (on the thread) to be confident in its correctness.",
      "revId": "367fdf8e2eefd4c32f38310a6be16f931e151d3f",
