      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure what you mean by above: you mean acquiring the SM lock? That seems okay since it ensures the SM thread won\u0027t do something unexpected during shutdown.\n\nI was considering that a way to run a callback on the power thread would be useful, but that ends up being mostly equivalent to locking while also having greater complexity.",
